       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60202.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60202.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Eliminar movimento interno                                 *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60202         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6020.
       COPY SWCV6021.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC  ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.

           05 WS-2210-BALC                 PIC S9(04) COMP-3.
           05 WS-2210-BALCX                PIC  9(04).
           05 WS-2210-CCB                  PIC  X(13).

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60202'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60202         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY VIAL0004.

           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6020-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6020-ASE               TO SWCV6021-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6020-ADE               TO SWCV6021-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
                 THRU 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-APRESENTA-DADOS'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6020-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE SWCV6020-MRNOPR            TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6020-MRNORD            TO SWCD7204-MRNORD.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT NCCCCBAN
                   , NCCCCSPAI
                   , NCCCCCONTA
                   , MRMOED
                   , MRDATL
                   , MRVLR
                   , MRDMOV
      *            , CREF
      *            , CREFOPR
               INTO  :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCCONTA
                   , :SWCD7204-MRMOED
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDMOV
      *            , :SWCD7204-CREF
      *            , :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
               FROM SWVT7204

              WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                AND MRNOPR   = :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                AND MRNORD   = :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

      * Obter SWCV6021-CCONTA
           IF DB2-OK
              PERFORM 2210-OBTER-CONTA
                 THRU 2210-OBTER-CONTA-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
           WHEN DB2-OK
              STRING
                 SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                 SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI      DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                         INTO SWCV6021-CSEND
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRMOED         TO SWCV6021-CMOED

              MOVE SWCD7204-MRDATL         TO AQCW0005-DT98
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10          TO SWCV6021-MRDATL

              MOVE SWCD7204-MRVLR          TO SWCV6021-MRVLR
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV         TO SWCV6021-MRDMOV
      *       MOVE SWCD7204-CREF           TO SWCV6021-CREF
      *       MOVE SWCD7204-CREFOPR        TO SWCV6021-CREFOPR

           WHEN DB2-NOTFND
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-MVNOTFND   TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           WHEN OTHER
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-ERR-REMOVER    TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV6021-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2210-OBTER-CONTA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-OBTER-CONTA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-OBTER-CONTA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT NCCCBALC
                   , NCCCCCB
                INTO :WS-2210-BALC
                   , :WS-2210-CCB
                FROM NCCCBCOR
               WHERE NCCCMOED  =  :SWCD7204-MRMOED
                 AND NCCCCBAN  =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI =  :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
                 MOVE WS-2210-BALC         TO WS-2210-BALCX
                 STRING WS-2210-BALCX
                        '-'
                        WS-2210-CCB        DELIMITED BY SIZE
                   INTO SWCV6021-CCONTA
      *       WHEN OTHER
      *          SET  VIAL0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *                                    TO TRUE
      *          SET  SWCV6011-CSEND-1     TO TRUE
      *          MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
      *                                    TO SWCV6011-CSEND-MSG
      *          MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV6011-CSEND-CAPLIC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2210-OBTER-CONTA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6021-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6021-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6021-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
